{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はNOGIBINGO!6放送されてましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「NOGI ROOM ～乃木坂46がパジャマで女子トーク～」第7夜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にも出てるよ～！\nhuluで是非見てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/25/3093059/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のメンバーは\n生駒ちゃん、ろってぃー、なーちゃん、ななみん、中田\nです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ全然見てない人に\nネタバレにならないようにざっくり\n中田がただただハッピーなやつです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"SHIBUYA TSUTAYAでまたもや\n乃木坂がジャックさせてもらってます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/25/3093059/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もイチオシ楽曲を書いたりしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/25/3093059/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もまた見に行きたいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の深夜\n乃木坂がニッポン放送の番組をジャックします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/25/3093059/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ミューコミ＋」\n「乃木坂46のオールナイトニッポン」\n「乃木坂46・新内眞衣のオールナイトニッポン0（ZERO）」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の3つの番組でメンバーが誰か出ます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で！中田も\nこの3番組のどこかで\n出演させていただきます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どの番組で出るかはお楽しみに～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/25/3093059/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4時間半も！\n聴いてね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオに備えて\n明日はどこかで昼寝しよっと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/25/3093059/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/25/3093059/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょしらくロスである。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかし、\nアルバム発売ってことで\nもういろいろ動いてますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"置いてきぼりにならないようにしなきゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}